    "merged means source is on the reviewed branch history, nothing more. package_qualified requires exact artifact kind and digest; closed additionally requires the qualifying test evidence.",
    "Audit text pinned to 198193b1 is historical evidence, never a current-head assertion. Other streams' findings and rows are not edited from this workstream."
